{"text":"The people who will remind you that you are not alone when your emotions get the best of you. Three, ask questions of yourself, for yourself, and listen out everywhere for the answers. Take reading recommendations from people you respect. It was in sitting in a talk back with a documentary filmmaker that I learned about the book, Fight Your Fear and Win, by Don Green. And it very literally got me out of my crisis before I went to Yale. That and the book Map for Life, a life management book by Glenn McQuirk, that my mother insisted for five years I read before I finally picked it up and I never regretted it. I go back to these books often.","words":[{"text":"The","start":0.0,"end":0.6},{"text":"people","start":0.6,"end":0.88},{"text":"who","start":0.88,"end":1.12},{"text":"will","start":1.12,"end":1.26},{"text":"remind","start":1.26,"end":1.74},{"text":"you","start":1.74,"end":2.16},{"text":"that","start":2.16,"end":2.6},{"text":"you","start":2.6,"end":2.76},{"text":"are","start":2.76,"end":2.9},{"text":"not","start":2.9,"end":3.08},{"text":"alone","start":3.08,"end":3.58},{"text":"when","start":3.58,"end":4.26},{"text":"your","start":4.26,"end":4.44},{"text":"emotions","start":4.44,"end":4.82},{"text":"get","start":4.82,"end":5.04},{"text":"the","start":5.04,"end":5.18},{"text":"best","start":5.18,"end":5.56},{"text":"of","start":5.56,"end":5.8},{"text":"you","start":5.8,"end":6.09,"punct":"."},{"text":"Three","start":6.74,"end":7.32,"punct":","},{"text":"ask","start":8.42,"end":8.64},{"text":"questions","start":8.64,"end":9.2},{"text":"of","start":9.2,"end":10.14},{"text":"yourself","start":10.14,"end":10.62,"punct":","},{"text":"for","start":11.26,"end":11.44},{"text":"yourself","start":11.44,"end":11.88,"punct":","},{"text":"and","start":12.38,"end":12.62},{"text":"listen","start":12.62,"end":12.9},{"text":"out","start":12.9,"end":13.24},{"text":"everywhere","start":13.24,"end":13.78},{"text":"for","start":13.78,"end":14.12},{"text":"the","start":14.12,"